# H5 主题

- `ThemeProvider` 只包裹 `<body>` 内子树；`<html suppressHydrationWarning>`
- `attribute="class"` + `@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *))`
- 改色须同步：`:root`/`.dark`、`lib/tokens.ts`
- `ThemeToggle` 用 `dark:hidden` / `hidden dark:inline`
